# Normalize all text files to LF, regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting or OS. Without this, Windows checkouts (where
# core.autocrlf defaults to true) diverge from what's actually committed,
# and `prettier --check` / `eslint` results become checkout-dependent
# instead of reflecting the real repository content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Line-ending normalization doesn't apply to genuinely binary formats;
# mark the common ones explicitly so git never attempts to diff/convert them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
